  "issue": "https://github.com/craigtrim/mutatoc/issues/28",
  "reason": "A plus sign is span syntax only when every part between the plus signs holds a word. With comma lists, the item decrease+ is a literal synonym, so it joins the synonym views and no longer makes a span rule that needs an empty word. The compound class human_behavior turns Human Behavior + Social Environment into human_behavior + + Social Environment, whose rule needed an empty word and is dropped. Neither dropped rule could match. Applied after comma-lists.json; the original trace is unchanged.",
